{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented the shared Jira-family link canonicalizer in rebar_reconciler.link_direction and collapsed both Cloud/DC map_remote_links methods to thin delegation. Added RED-first coverage for standalone loading, outward/inward/symmetric/unmapped/fallback/dedup cases, backend delegation, and parity against the captured issuelinks fixture. Validation: focused link suites green, make lint green, make typecheck green, and pytest -m 'not integration and not external' -x -q reached only the known baseline lifecycle failure after 1303 passes."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788425471670719001,"uuid":"2747fb9c-3b77-44b5-ad04-2c72605a2ced"}